しで、海外の病院で手術を受けることを決意。その際に静也に好意を伝え、「大人になったら結婚しよう」と約束。祖父からもらった懐中時計の巻き鍵を約束の証として静也に渡す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで凜とした雰囲気の少女。 名家・千鳥家の令嬢であり次期当主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お人好しの両親に代わって、千鳥家が関わる事業の交渉役に立っている才媛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"財界からはその天才的かつ厳しい投資手腕から “氷の令嬢” と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただしそれはビジネスのためで、静也と二人きりの時は年頃の女の子らしく振舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれつき病弱で、幼少期のほとんどがベッドで寝たきりの生活をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"7年ほど前、病状が悪化して入院した頃に静也と出会い親しくなった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あまり堅苦しくしなくていいわよ。 いつも気を張ってたら、息が詰まるでしょ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56311"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08710c82b8ecb58605cfab72a9f4bff621430f3445ac2cc2270811026ca6fcef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd96939cb35cca3e51e413634814c3353cea07eb856b83fa545e21c8a5c4d37c.webp","width":148,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"篠原麻李","creatorId":"vndb:s3370","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3370","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3370","name":"篠原 麻李","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:220156:56311:20830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63113","characterName":"佐々木 静也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63113"},"originalCharacterName":"佐々木 静也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":